{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
 The resulting Opinions, which are published,
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs16 
{\*\bkmkstart co_fnRef_6ead5fc6-097d-4a0e-b67a-eb8b4b3}{\*\bkmkend co_fnRef_6ead5fc6-097d-4a0e-b67a-eb8b4b3}
