11
}}}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
 provide valuable guidance, including on many issues that have not been the subject of litigation. Secondly, in 1997, the 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs20 
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
ICC
}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
 approved the Rules for 
}
{\b1 \cf24 \f2 \i0 \fs20 \chcbpat42 
{\b1 \cf24 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
Documentary
}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs20 \chcbpat2 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
 Credit Dispute Resolution Expertise (the DOCDEX rules) in response to demand for cost-effective, informed dispute resolution. The rules provide for a dispute relating to the interpretation of 
}
{\b1 \cf24 \f2 \i0 \fs20 \chcbpat42 
{\b1 \cf24 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
uniform
}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs20 \chcbpat2 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
 rules promulgated by the 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs20 
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
ICC
}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
 to be put to a panel of three experts appointed by the 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs20 
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
ICC
}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
\u8217\'3fs International Centre for Expertise from a list of experts maintained by the ICC Banking Commission. The experts are anonymous, the procedure is entirely in writing, and the decision is non-binding. The 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs20 
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
ICC
}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
 has the right to publish DOCDEX decisions provided it does not disclose the identity of the parties.
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs16 
