{\super \b0 \cf23 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs15 \sa0 \sb0 
19
}}}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
 At the same time, regard must be had to the UCP\u8217\'3fs international character and its purpose and function within the international trade finance system. In 
}
{\field {\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://uk.westlaw.com/Link/Document/FullText?findType=Y&serNum=2024443325&pubNum=6448&originatingDoc=I8CC6FA006E3211E782BDB54604FBEE92&refType=UC&originationContext=document&vr=3.0&rs=PLUK1.0&transitionType=CommentaryUKLink&contextData=(sc.Search)" }{\fldrslt 
{\b0 \cf23 \f2 \i1 \fs20 
