{\super \b0 \cf23 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs15 \sa0 \sb0 
22
}}}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
 On the same basis, regard may be had to DOCDEX arbitration awards.
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs16 
{\*\bkmkstart co_fnRef_3635faf4-ccfb-4b28-83d2-65f795e}{\*\bkmkend co_fnRef_3635faf4-ccfb-4b28-83d2-65f795e}
{\field {\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#co_footnote_3635faf4-ccfb-4b28-83d2-65f7" }{\fldrslt 
