{\b0 \cf23 \f2 \i0 \fs20 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
On occasion, English courts have been persuaded of the need to acknowledge an implied term in the UCP in accordance with orthodox common law principles.
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs16 
{\*\bkmkstart co_fnRef_4e0cb1bd-9250-42b9-b31d-ef952bb}{\*\bkmkend co_fnRef_4e0cb1bd-9250-42b9-b31d-ef952bb}
{\field {\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#co_footnote_4e0cb1bd-9250-42b9-b31d-ef95" }{\fldrslt 
{\super \b0 \cf23 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs15 \sa0 \sb0 
24
}}}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb200 
 The approach to interpretation of the UCP outlined by Thomas L.J., however, mandates caution before courts of any one jurisdiction jeopardise the harmonisation achieved by the UCP by writing in new provisions in the form of terms implied in accordance with any national law, as distinct from implication by way of interpretation in accordance with the broader international and commercial perspective of the UCP itself, as indicated above.
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs16 
{\*\bkmkstart co_fnRef_ae88188e-6380-4f4e-a029-9bca850}{\*\bkmkend co_fnRef_ae88188e-6380-4f4e-a029-9bca850}
{\field {\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#co_footnote_ae88188e-6380-4f4e-a029-9bca" }{\fldrslt 
{\super \b0 \cf23 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs15 \sa0 \sb0 
25
}}}
\par 
}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 
}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
\u160\'3f
\par 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ri0 \i0 \qj \fs20 \li0 
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 
}
{\b0 \cf40 \f2 \ri0 \i0 \ql \fs20 \li0 
{\b0 \cf23 \f2 \i0 \fs20 
}
{\b0 \cf23 \f2 \i0 \fs20 
}
{\b0 \cf40 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa160 \sb320 
Conflict between the UCP and bespoke terms of the credit
\par 
}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ri0 \i0 \qj \fs20 \li0 
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ri10080 \i0 \qj \fs20 \li-760 
{\b1 \cf18 \f2 \ri10080 \i0 \qj \fs20 \li-760 
{\b1 \cf18 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa100 \sb0 
23-008
\par 
}
}
}
{\b0 \cf23 \f2 \i0 \fs20 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
It follows from the fact that the UCP does not have force of law that it can be incorporated into a credit subject to modification. It is then a question of interpretation whether a particular term of the credit indeed overrides a contrary provision of the UCP. Five points may, however, be made. First, given the worldwide adoption of the UCP and the benefits that flow from the resulting uniformity of approach to 
}
{\b1 \cf24 \f2 \i0 \fs20 \chcbpat42 
{\b1 \cf24 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
documentary
}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs20 \chcbpat2 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
 
}
{\b1 \cf24 \f2 \i0 \fs20 \chcbpat42 
{\b1 \cf24 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
credits
}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs20 \chcbpat2 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
, a court may legitimately hesitate before concluding that the parties intended to depart from such an internationally accepted regime and may require the clearest wording to evidence such intention. In 
}
{\field {\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://uk.westlaw.com/Link/Document/FullText?findType=Y&serNum=1986026480&pubNum=4891&originatingDoc=I8CC6FA006E3211E782BDB54604FBEE92&refType=UC&originationContext=document&vr=3.0&rs=PLUK1.0&transitionType=CommentaryUKLink&contextData=(sc.Search)" }{\fldrslt 
{\b0 \cf23 \f2 \i1 \fs20 
{\b0 \cf23 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i1 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
Forestal Mimosa Ltd v Oriental Credit Ltd
}
}}}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
,
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs16 
{\*\bkmkstart co_fnRef_701af66b-fedf-4626-a238-1de3de1}{\*\bkmkend co_fnRef_701af66b-fedf-4626-a238-1de3de1}
{\field {\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#co_footnote_701af66b-fedf-4626-a238-1de3" }{\fldrslt 
{\super \b0 \cf23 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs15 \sa0 \sb0 
26
}}}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
 the credit provided that it was subject to the UCP \u8220\'3fexcept so far as otherwise expressly stated\u8221\'3f. It was held that the UCP would be overridden only in the event of an \u8220\'3firreconcilable inconsistency\u8221\'3f.
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs16 
{\*\bkmkstart co_fnRef_5c507433-1bf3-4173-9bd5-923c3e8}{\*\bkmkend co_fnRef_5c507433-1bf3-4173-9bd5-923c3e8}
