{\super \b0 \cf23 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs15 \sa0 \sb0 
37
}}}
\par 
}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ri0 \i0 \qj \fs20 \li0 
{\b0 \cf23 \f2 \i0 \fs20 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb200 
Fifthly, in the final analysis, a term may create a fundamental inconsistency within the instrument, undermining its core commercial purpose. A court will naturally strive to construe a term so as to avoid such an inconsistency. Ultimately, however, a choice may have to be made between giving effect to the clause at the expense of denying the core commercial essence of the instrument and declining to accept that the parties can have intended such denial, forcing rejection of the clause that is repugnant to that essence.
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs16 
{\*\bkmkstart co_fnRef_ba0e8569-9290-4938-a185-efceeb6}{\*\bkmkend co_fnRef_ba0e8569-9290-4938-a185-efceeb6}
