38
}}}
\par 
}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ri0 \i0 \qj \fs20 \li0 
{\b0 \cf23 \f2 \i0 \fs20 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
Sixthly, a specific problem arises in connection with non-
}
{\b1 \cf24 \f2 \i0 \fs20 \chcbpat42 
{\b1 \cf24 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
documentary
}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs20 \chcbpat2 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
 conditions. A condition that is not attached to a document required to be presented requires the bank to look outside the presentation to underlying circumstances, violating the 
}
{\b1 \cf24 \f2 \i0 \fs20 \chcbpat42 
{\b1 \cf24 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
documentary
}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs20 \chcbpat2 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
 nature of the credit and possibly the autonomy principle. At common law, it has been held that a bank to which a presentation has been made should call for 
}
{\b1 \cf24 \f2 \i0 \fs20 \chcbpat42 
{\b1 \cf24 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
documentary
}
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs20 \chcbpat2 
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \ul0 \strike0 \i0 \fs20 \sa0 \sb0 
 evidence of fulfilment of the condition.
}
{\b0 \cf21 \f2 \i0 \fs16 
{\*\bkmkstart co_fnRef_3f101bdc-7e92-4c7a-bc2d-3d9ae7d}{\*\bkmkend co_fnRef_3f101bdc-7e92-4c7a-bc2d-3d9ae7d}
